{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"operations\":[{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-identification-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-identification-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-1\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"confidential information marked\",\"marked confidential or proprietary\",\"identified and labeled confidential\",\"identified at the time of disclosure\",\"identified as non-public or confidential\",\"designated in writing as confidential\",\"presumed to be confidential information\",\"does not need to be identified\",\"not marked by notifying\",\"reduced to writing by disclosing party\",\"information that is marked\",\"otherwise designated as being confidential\",\"marked as proprietary confidential\",\"states to be sensitive confidential\",\"clearly marked or otherwise identified\",\"designated as confidential at the time of disclosure\",\"marked confidential or should be deemed\",\"document marked confidential\",\"considered confidential information\",\"all information received shall be considered confidential information\",\"whether it be marked confidential or not\",\"treated as confidential\",\"regardless of whether such information is specifically identified as confidential\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":1,\"after\":2,\"include_list_preamble\":false}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select clauses making marking, designation, notice, or a default rule govern confidentiality; include the governing definition and alternatives. Exclude mere document labels and unrelated notice provisions.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[346,164,371,360,125,608,522,364,529,304,427,337,291,420],\"rationale\":\"Observed omissions and role errors persist despite visible marking clauses, especially where confidentiality follows notification, objective treatment, or a default rule. The generalized additions replace party-specific wording and publish the corresponding selection criterion.\"},{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-rights-term-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-rights-term-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-15\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"no license\",\"no rights\",\"grant any right\",\"grant of a license\",\"grants any license\",\"granting or conferring any rights\",\"does not convey any right\",\"grants no rights\",\"no license under or title\",\"no license or other right\",\"no transfer or license\",\"no right or license is granted\",\"does not grant any implied intellectual property licenses\",\"grant data recipient any intellectual property rights or licenses\",\"remain the property\",\"property of the disclosing party\",\"grant or transfer any right\",\"all other rights are reserved\",\"retain title and all ownership rights\",\"deemed a transfer or assignment\",\"deemed a grant or waiver\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":1,\"after\":2,\"include_list_preamble\":false}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select operative clauses addressing rights in confidential information or related intellectual property: no-license, ownership, reserved-rights, or express limited grants. Include exceptions only when they define the grant's scope.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[501,312,249,164,253,421,619,522,230,364,529,304,132,315,578,337,439,291],\"rationale\":\"Visible ownership and reserved-rights members were repeatedly omitted or displaced by nearby limited-use language. The criterion distinguishes direct rights provisions from context while preserving express grants that delimit scope.\"},{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-agreement-solicitation-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-agreement-solicitation-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-10\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"existence and terms of this agreement\",\"contents of this agreement\",\"existence or contents of this agreement\",\"fact that discussions\",\"discussions or negotiations\",\"negotiations are taking place\",\"public announcement of or otherwise disclose the existence\",\"existence and content of discussions\",\"existence of the discussions\",\"fact that the parties hereto are considering\",\"public statement concerning the existence of this agreement\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":1,\"after\":1,\"include_list_preamble\":false},{\"all_phrases\":[\"subject matter\",\"confidential information\"],\"any_phrases\":[],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":0,\"after\":0,\"include_list_preamble\":false}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select definitions or operative nondisclosure clauses covering the agreement's existence or contents, negotiations, or transaction discussions; include linked definition and prohibition. Exclude entire-agreement boilerplate and unrelated publicity.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[346,422,249,603,524,608,619,522,427,578,337],\"rationale\":\"Multiple direct hits defining discussions or agreement existence as confidential were visible but unused. The criterion identifies responsive definition and prohibition clauses while separating boilerplate references to the agreement.\"},{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-sharing-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-sharing-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-7\",\"nda-5\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"representative means\",\"representatives shall mean\",\"authorized parties means\",\"term representatives\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":1,\"after\":2,\"include_list_preamble\":true},{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"may disclose\",\"only disclose\",\"except to its employees\",\"except to its affiliates\",\"employees representatives or agents\",\"disclosure to representatives\",\"disclosed to any employee consultant\",\"representatives who need to know\",\"persons employed by\",\"share confidential data with persons having authorized access\",\"restrict dissemination of confidential information\",\"employees of data recipient\",\"contractors of data recipient\",\"partners employees consultants professional advisors\",\"employees independent contractors advisors or affiliates\",\"disseminate confidential information only\",\"will not disclose any confidential information\",\"make no disclosures of any confidential information\",\"limit access to confidential information\",\"not to use or disclose to another person\",\"may be disclosed only to employees or contractors\",\"not disclose to any third party except\",\"not share\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":2,\"after\":3,\"include_list_preamble\":false}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select the operative disclosure or access clause and recipient definitions it invokes. Distinguish employees from nonemployee representatives, advisers, agents, or contractors; exclude responsibility and security clauses standing alone.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[501,282,123,422,230,364,529,304,315,291,420],\"rationale\":\"Employee-only, authorized-access, and contrary nondisclosure clauses were frequently accessible yet omitted, while some nearby restrictions were mistaken for sharing evidence. Added compact recipient wording and a category-sensitive selection criterion.\"},{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-compelled-notice-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-compelled-notice-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-8\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"prompt prior written notice\",\"prompt written notice\",\"written notice of such legal requirement\",\"shall notify\",\"be notified\",\"notify promptly\",\"promptly notify\",\"immediately notify\",\"give the discloser as much notice\",\"provide the other party with prompt notice\",\"after notifying the other party\",\"provides notification to disclosing party\",\"give to the other written notice\",\"written notice of the order or request\",\"as soon as reasonably possible of the required disclosure\",\"notice prior to such disclosure\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":4,\"after\":2,\"include_list_preamble\":false},{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"required by law\",\"legally required\",\"legally compelled\",\"subpoena or similar legal process\",\"subpoena or other legal process\",\"valid and effective subpoena\",\"court order law\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":1,\"after\":2,\"include_list_preamble\":false}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select a clause coupling legally compelled disclosure with notice to the source, owner, or contractual counterpart entitled to notice; include separated trigger and notice language. Exclude unrelated breach notices.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[339,346,249,164,253,371,360,125,524,608,619,522,364,529,304,132,427,315,578,337,439],\"rationale\":\"The lawyer confused notification roles and omitted visible compelled-disclosure duties. Party-specific vocabulary was removed in favor of portable timing language, and the criterion requires the legal trigger and proper notice recipient.\"},{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-retention-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-retention-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-20\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"may retain\",\"may each retain\",\"retain one archival copy\",\"not be required to destroy\",\"not required to purge\",\"standard electronic backup and archival procedures\",\"established document retention policies\",\"historical back-up media\",\"automated processes such as archiving\",\"except as may be otherwise required by law\",\"retain no copies\",\"no copy thereof shall be retained\",\"no copies will be made or retained\",\"all confidential information and copies\",\"return all proprietary information\",\"all material embodying confidential information\",\"without retaining in whole or in part any copies\",\"shall not retain any copies\",\"may retain such of its documents\",\"shall not be deemed to have retained\",\"computer backup tapes\",\"records department may retain one copy\",\"except for copies of any computer records or electronic files\",\"return or destroy all the other party's confidential information\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":2,\"after\":2,\"include_list_preamble\":false}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select express post-return or destruction retention permission or prohibition, including backup, archive, legal-retention, and no-copy terms. Include the return duty only when needed to establish timing or scope.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[501,422,312,249,164,371,360,125,524,608,619,522,364,529,132,427,315,578,337,439,291],\"rationale\":\"Retention outcomes were often inferred from generic return language, while explicit backup, archive, legal-retention, and no-copy members were missed. Added recurrent formulations and a criterion separating the retention witness from its trigger.\"},{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-third-party-source-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-third-party-source-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-13\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"from a third party\",\"by a third party\",\"from another source\",\"source other than\",\"lawfully disclosed\",\"lawfully obtained\",\"lawfully in the possession\",\"rightfully received by the receiving party\",\"acquired by data recipient from a source other than\",\"subsequently communicated\",\"later acquired by the receiving party\",\"receiving information from other parties\",\"available on a non-confidential basis from a source\",\"received from another source who can disclose it lawfully\",\"independently received from a third party\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":3,\"after\":1,\"include_list_preamble\":true}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select an exception or permission for information received or acquired from an independent third-party source, together with lawful, rightful, or no-confidentiality conditions. Exclude representative disclosure and independent-development clauses.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[346,422,312,249,164,253,371,360,125,524,608,421,619,522,230,364,529,304,132,427,315,578,337,439,420],\"rationale\":\"Several recurring non-confidential-source formulations were visible but not selected, and independent development or representative sharing was sometimes substituted. The additions and criterion isolate third-party acquisition conditions.\"},{\"operation\":\"UPDATE\",\"target_ids\":[\"source-acquisition-reverse-engineering-v1\"],\"skill\":{\"id\":\"source-acquisition-reverse-engineering-v1\",\"hypothesis_ids\":[\"nda-11\"],\"guidance\":{\"source_queries\":[{\"all_phrases\":[],\"any_phrases\":[\"reverse engineer\",\"reverse engineering\",\"disassemble\",\"decompile\",\"systematic attempt to recreate\",\"recreate the material\",\"recreate the material by memory\"],\"none_phrases\":[],\"before\":1,\"after\":1,\"include_list_preamble\":false}],\"evidence_criterion\":\"Select operative prohibitions on reverse engineering, decompiling, disassembling, or systematic recreation of protected material. Include scope-limiting exceptions; exclude ordinary copying, reproduction, disclosure, or confidentiality language alone.\"}},\"source_case_ids\":[421,295,439],\"rationale\":\"A directly matched systematic-recreation witness was omitted, while unrelated oral, copying, and confidentiality text generated false relations elsewhere. The published criterion separates reverse-engineering conduct from adjacent restrictions.\"}],\"noop_reason\":null}"}}
